From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cumin <13809292481@163.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:24:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] esp32: build against ESP-IDF v6 (micropython#19725).

The ESP-IDF v6 compatibility commits of micropython/micropython#19725, as
they stand in #19726 at 0b9512f475bd (19e685eca..8634a282a), squashed and
rebased onto the micropython pin with the PyDevices overlay applied. Only
the ESP32-S31 build carries this patch.

Left out: the CI workflow, tools/ci.sh and the component lockfiles of the
other chips, which no S31 build reads. The tinyusb entry of
ports/esp32/main/idf_component.yml keeps the overlay's TinyUSB 0.21 here;
the next patch moves it, as upstream's does. The P4 cameraif components
stay in the manifest.
